{"id":"c09","stage":1,"title":"乘坐公交","scene":"确认公交的方向和下车地点。","roles":["你","乘客"],"lines":[{"id":"c09-1","ko":"이 버스가 시청에 가요?","zh":"这辆公交到市政府吗？","note":"가다 后的目的地用 에。","words":[{"term":"버스","zh":"公交车","id":"fb84fa7f86eac62e","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3"},{"term":"시청","zh":"市政府","id":"d089c9bf766d3808","audio":"/audio/d089c9bf766d3808ef00.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/28f0231a6714c3d8a454.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这","explanation":"이是指示限定词。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"버스가","meaning":"辆公交","explanation":"버스（公交车）+ 가（主格助词）。","readings":[{"term":"버스","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"버스가","audio":"/audio/4a5fae1e77392a579e0a.mp3"}},{"text":"시청에","meaning":"到市政府","explanation":"시청（市政府）+ 에（目的地）。","readings":[{"term":"시청","audio":"/audio/d089c9bf766d3808ef00.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시청에","audio":"/audio/ee8799cbc7a4129ad3af.mp3"}},{"text":"가요?","meaning":"去吗？","explanation":"가다（去）→ 가요，礼貌疑问形式。","readings":[{"term":"가요","audio":"/audio/f56d0f13cacc6a44dd26.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가요","audio":"/audio/f56d0f13cacc6a44dd26.mp3"}}]},{"id":"c09-2","ko":"네, 시청 앞에 서요.","zh":"到，在市政府前面停。","note":"서다 在这里指车辆停靠。","words":[{"term":"서다","zh":"停；站","id":"4fccaaf883d3c239","audio":"/audio/4fccaaf883d3c239af91.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/eafd992d58535c032f05.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"到","explanation":"네肯定回答上文。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"시청","meaning":"市政府","explanation":"시청与앞组成“市政府前面”。","readings":[{"term":"시청","audio":"/audio/d089c9bf766d3808ef00.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시청","audio":"/audio/d089c9bf766d3808ef00.mp3"}},{"text":"앞에","meaning":"在前面","explanation":"앞（前面）+ 에（位置）。","readings":[{"term":"앞에","audio":"/audio/6ee410c0325daaa6155d.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞에","audio":"/audio/6ee410c0325daaa6155d.mp3"}},{"text":"서요.","meaning":"停","explanation":"서다（站、停）→ 서요；这里指车辆停靠。","readings":[{"term":"서다","audio":"/audio/4fccaaf883d3c239af91.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"서요","audio":"/audio/de1a4bca46ac12eb51e0.mp3"}}]},{"id":"c09-3","ko":"몇 정거장 가야 해요?","zh":"要坐几站？","note":"-아/어야 하다：必须、需要。","words":[{"term":"정거장","zh":"车站","id":"6cc88bd83df3334b","audio":"/audio/6cc88bd83df3334b2402.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/146c519e9a38d3f408ef.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"몇","meaning":"几","explanation":"몇询问数量。","readings":[{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}},{"text":"정거장","meaning":"站","explanation":"정거장（车站）；这里用于计算经过几站。","readings":[{"term":"정거장","audio":"/audio/6cc88bd83df3334b2402.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정거장","audio":"/audio/6cc88bd83df3334b2402.mp3"}},{"text":"가야","meaning":"要坐／去","explanation":"가다（去）+ -아야，与해요组成“需要”。","readings":[{"term":"가야","audio":"/audio/6aca1779d1b3c7fc08b4.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가야","audio":"/audio/6aca1779d1b3c7fc08b4.mp3"}},{"text":"해요?","meaning":"需要吗？","explanation":"하다→해요；-아/어야 하다整体表示必须、需要。","readings":[{"term":"해요","audio":"/audio/521029965a4dd3b2882e.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해요","audio":"/audio/521029965a4dd3b2882e.mp3"}}]},{"id":"c09-4","ko":"세 정거장 가면 돼요.","zh":"坐三站就到了。","note":"셋 在量词前变为 세。","words":[{"term":"셋","zh":"三（固有数词）","id":"28ed1f7d8986d21d","audio":"/audio/28ed1f7d8986d21d30a5.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/e1d2cbc4ca91b7d486da.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"세","meaning":"三","explanation":"셋（三）在名词或量词前用세。","readings":[{"term":"셋","audio":"/audio/28ed1f7d8986d21d30a5.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"세","audio":"/audio/1bcc05bddb3c9e8c0bec.mp3"}},{"text":"정거장","meaning":"站","explanation":"정거장这里作为计数单位。","readings":[{"term":"정거장","audio":"/audio/6cc88bd83df3334b2402.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정거장","audio":"/audio/6cc88bd83df3334b2402.mp3"}